---

<section class="mc-cta-final">
    <div class="mc-cta-final-content">
        <h2>Competiția ta nu așteaptă. Tu de ce aștepți?</h2>
        <p>În timp ce tu citești asta, competitorii tăi investesc. Întrebarea nu e dacă să faci un audit. Întrebarea e cât te costă să nu-l faci.</p>
        <div class="mc-cta-final-buttons">
            <button class="mc-cta-primary" data-open-booking>
                <span class="mc-cta-shine"></span>
                Activează Market Command
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                    <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
                </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="mc-cta-secondary" data-open-booking>
                Programează o Discuție Strategică
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .mc-cta-final {
        padding: 5rem 2rem;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .mc-cta-final::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.06) 0%, transparent 70%);
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .mc-cta-final-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 650px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .mc-cta-final h2 {
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .mc-cta-final p {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .mc-cta-final-buttons {
        display: flex;
        gap: 1rem;
        justify-content: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .mc-cta-primary {
        position: relative;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
        background: var(--mc-red);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .mc-cta-primary svg {
        width: 18px;
        height: 18px;
        transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .mc-cta-primary:hover {
        transform: translateY(-3px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 40px var(--mc-red-glow);
    }

    .mc-cta-primary:hover svg {
        transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .mc-cta-shine {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: -100%;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
        transition: left 0.5s ease;
    }

    .mc-cta-primary:hover .mc-cta-shine {
        left: 100%;
    }

    .mc-cta-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 1rem 2rem;
        background: transparent;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-medium);
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .mc-cta-secondary:hover {
        border-color: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.4);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--mc-red-glow);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    :global([data-theme="light"]) .mc-cta-final::before {
        background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.04) 0%, transparent 70%);
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .mc-cta-final-buttons {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .mc-cta-primary,
        .mc-cta-secondary {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 320px;
            justify-content: center;
        }
    }
</style>
